','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In June 2020, the Group terminated its share incentive plan adopted in December 2010, November 2013, April 2014 (the &#8220;Terminated Plans&#8221;) and adopted a 2020 share incentive plan, which is referred to as the 2020 Share Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2020 Plan&#8221;). The awards that are granted and outstanding under the Terminated Plans remain effective under the 2020 Plan, subject to any amendment and modification to the original award agreements that the Company shall determine.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025, the number of vested shares relating to the Terminated Plans was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_S4H0UpdNEkCzdcUtES98UA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xnet_ShareIncentivePlans20102013And2014Member_1wmkKjwc90agD_a-6gjg9Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_uu2ccy2Yi0O8yhPIM_Cp9A">320,000</ix:nonFraction>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_S4H0UpdNEkCzdcUtES98UA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xnet_ShareIncentivePlans20102013And2014Member_LrPnBX5cskiUaMTTYOBURg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_O0kF9LDEUUWkn2u8FPZZqg">nil</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_S4H0UpdNEkCzdcUtES98UA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xnet_ShareIncentivePlans20102013And2014Member_LQOUgUdDH0uNQ-0Hb8-IFg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrang