 of intellectual property rights, labor disputes and other routine and incidental matters to its business, among others. Adverse results in these cases may include awards of damages and may also result in, or even compel, a change in the Group<span style="font-family:'Georgia';">&#8217;</span>s business practices, which could impact the Group<span style="font-family:'Georgia';">&#8217;</span>s future financial results. The Group has not recorded any material liabilities in this regard as of December 31, 2024 and 2025.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_BKUqmdgPg0KMyqSNWKa1zw" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_TdJGBMrBjEmppQZIgOHd7g" continuedAt="Tb_TdJGBMrBjEmppQZIgOHd7g_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">27.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Concentration and risks</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Concentration of customer risk</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The top <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_customer_lQSpa6we206uyYxYDrDt8g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_BKUqmdgPg0KMyqSNWKa1zw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xnet:ConcentrationRiskNumberOfTopCustomers" scale="0" id="Narr_ej6OkmMYpEGhR-DuKMiauQ">10</ix:nonFraction> customers accounted for approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_s84E49noE0C5LJg3V9vbAA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_xne