rch 16, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2025, Shenzhen Onething had total assets of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gRXeGHedr0KrVBeB9p2KmA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupHeldforsaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_xnet_ShenzhenOnethingTechnologiesCoLtdShenzhenOnethingMember_VAzMV4h9-UavSa05O6vuBA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetsOfDisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperation" scale="6" id="Narr_RQ7bf9KWp02TxAyXgVNfpQ">74.4</ix:nonFraction> million and net assets of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gRXeGHedr0KrVBeB9p2KmA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupHeldforsaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_xnet_ShenzhenOnethingTechnologiesCoLtdShenzhenOnethingMember_VAzMV4h9-UavSa05O6vuBA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xnet:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationNetAssets" scale="6" id="Narr_zEejYpynhUuGy_ILJibgog">34.1</ix:nonFraction> million, and net income of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_gRXeGHedr0KrVBeB9p2KmA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupHeldforsaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_xnet_ShenzhenOnethingTechnologiesCoLtdShenzhenOnethingMember_YI055p5_tE6F0e7f3hl3VA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationOperatingIncomeLoss" scale="6" id="Narr_oxzRWrbAq0WHYTOlgL81_A">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million for the year then ended.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">As a result of the transaction, the Company<span style="font-family:'Georgia';">&#8217;</span>s equity interest in Shenzhen Onething decreased from <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_s84E49noE0C5LJg3V9vbAA" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2026_srt_OwnershipAxis_xnet_ShenzhenOnethingTechnologiesCoLtdShenzhenOnethingMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_Btdu1h4NQ0Ge1P-XfeTnFg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" id="Narr_W_KyIHUDnUie6GoSG849rQ">70</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_s84E49noE0C5LJg3V9vbAA" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2026_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_xnet_ShenzhenOnethingTechnologiesCoLtdShenzhenOnethingMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_iIWU3uzbREabA2PHXYpcLw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_g3wrC9OwukGs6vlgUzRL7A">20</ix:nonFraction>%, and the Company lost its controlling financial interest. The Company deconsolidated Shenzhen Onething effective March 16, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">The Company expects to recognize a gain or loss on the deconsolidation in the first quarter of 2026 in accordance with ASC 810-10-40. As of the date of issuance of these financial statements, the Company has not completed the fair value assessment of its retained <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_s84E49noE0C5LJg3V9vbAA" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2026_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_xnet_ShenzhenOnethingTechnologiesCoLtdShenzhenOnethingMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeA